window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Two enemies. One competition. And a dangerous magical world they must survive. At 21 years old, my focus should be on college, boys, and friends. Instead, I’m one of the chosen. One of two people capable of going to a magical world to bring back a resource my people need to survive.</p> <p>The only problem? The only other person who can go to this world is my greatest enemy: Callum. An arrogant, stubborn man who drives me wild. Even though we can never be together.</p> <p>But while that would be enough to make anyone crazy, there’s also a mystery I must solve. My mother is dead. My father is missing. And the council I serve? They just might be involved in all of it. Can I handle my enemy, my responsibility, and the truth? Or will it be my undoing?</p> <p><i>The Royal Gold Keepers</i> is the set of all the books in a new adult fantasy romance. It has lots of steam, lots of world building, and a mystery that will leave you hanging on until the very end.</p>"; 
